{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Video Nightz... a video game about a video store set in 1999!</strong><br><br>It\u2019s 1999 and Y2K is upon us. You are the owner of an independent video store that a corporation is eyeing off to purchase. Help your customers find the perfect video by listening to their stories and decide what the future is for your video store.<br><br>A satirical look at the lives, interests and subcultures at the turn of the 21st century. <br><br>Video Nightz is a feature-length visual novel-style game, taking influences from Interactive Fiction, Store Simulators, and Point &amp; Click Adventures.<br><br><i>Note:</i>\u00a0<i>This game is all about talking and recommending (not a store management/simulation).</i><br><br>   <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters:</strong> Meet a wide range of customers from various 90s subcultures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tastemaker:</strong>\u00a0Recommend videos from the Staff Picks shelf.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conversations:</strong> Get to know your customers and learn about their personalities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Y2K:</strong> Taking place over 12 nights in the final months of 1999 during the lead-up to the year 2000.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics:</strong> Pixel art inspired by 90s TV animation. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soundtrack:</strong> 90s hip hop influenced beats bumpin' straight from your store\u2019s boom box.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runtime:</strong> Estimated 120 - 240 minutes, about as long as a long movie or a short TV miniseries.</p></li></ul>","background":